  "description": "<strong>Dataset Update (July 31, 2025):</strong> This dataset is now sourced from a new system following a planned system migration. For questions or feedback, please contact support@datasf.org.\n\n<strong>A. SUMMARY</strong>\nStreet Tree Removal public notifications managed by San Francisco Public Works.\n\n<strong>B. HOW THE DATASET IS CREATED</strong>\nData is based on 24-hour, 15-day, or 30-day public notices posted on the trees after a Street Tree Removal Permit was issued by the City.\n\n<strong>C. UPDATE PROCESS</strong>\nUpdated daily.\n\n<strong>D. HOW TO USE THIS DATASET</strong>\nEach record is a street tree removal public notice after a permit was issued and the tree was recommended for removal.",
